    "description": "RESTful API collection for Optimum Solutions Group platform.\n\n**Includes:**\n- Authentication (login, register, refresh, logout)\n- User management (profile, CRUD)\n- Contact form submission\n- Analytics (events, performance, report)\n- Content (posts CRUD)\n\n**Usage:**\n1. Import the environment file and select it\n2. Run `Auth > Login` to obtain a token\n3. Token is auto-stored in `auth_token` for secured requests",
